{"time": 1766067574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1655471129]你要徒手爬上玻璃外壳的百米高楼？（难度30的攀爬吧）"}
{"time": 1766067575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910928657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这也不能说是月亮吧?看着像人造的东西。”对这个倒是有些兴趣，不过还是优先要解决魔力的问题。"}
{"time": 1766067596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782737578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2104466578]显然没那么厉害，看不到"}
